error[SC0275]: `I64?` cannot be interpolated: it does not implement `Display`
 --> tests/ui/types/interpolated_value_is_not_displayable.science:8:14
  |
8 |     print(f"{found}")
  |              ^^^^^ this is `I64?`
  |
  = note: an interpolation renders its value through `Display`. A nullable does not implement it until it is narrowed, and a value that implements nothing needs an `implements Display:` block before it can be printed

